  "title": "Some Girls",
  "country": "UK",
  "released": "1978-06-09",
  "notes": "Original UK release in matte die-cut cover with uncensored cardboard toploader inner sleeve with rounded corners.\nThe cover front has pale yellow/blue/red/green colour bands and the title 'Some Girls' in red.\nFirst catalogue number on cover, inner sleeve & labels, 2nd (EMI international cat.#) boxed on cover back top right.\n\nSimilar to [r=16253649] but that one does not have Ted Jensen's lacquer cut initials in the runouts.\n\nAnother Production of the Glimmer Twins\n\n℗ 1978 Promotone B.V.\n\nA3 appears as \"Imagination\" on cover, but as \"Just My Imagination (Running Away With Me)\" on label.\nB1 appears as \"Far Away Eyes\" on cover, but as \"Faraway Eyes\" on label.\n\n'MADE IN GT BRITAIN' on the labels.\n\nRunouts 'CUN 39108 A[X]U TJ' and 'CUN 39108 B[X]U TJ' are etched, remainder is stamped.",
  "released_formatted": "09 Jun 1978",
